e match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.poster.avif?t=1754063662\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.webm?t=1754063662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.mp4?t=1754063662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn fighting game concepts by playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't know what cross-counter, priority, or cross-up hits are? Don't worry! The game will show you them as they happen, and you'll learn by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rollback netcode ensures a responsive low latency gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong>: An amazing single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Battle against your friends on the same couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0across\u00a0<strong>3 Unique Factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>7 Stages</strong>\u00a0designed for intense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40+ Terrains\u00a0</strong>offering diverse strategic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rollback Netcode Multiplayer</strong>\u00a0for smooth, cross-platform online play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay tuned for updates as we bring this vision to life!</p>",
